WEBVTT

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.465
Because the number of applicants

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:11.553
for Otonokizaka High
exceeded our expectations,

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:15.223
we will be accepting applications
for the coming year.

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:19.853
I hope the third years will spend
their remaining school days

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:23.565
without regrets, and enjoy
fruitful day-to-day lives.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:26.651
And as for the first and second years...

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:30.739
I hope you will be worthy role models
for all of the new students,

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:34.034
and continue to move
forward with renewed spirits.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.620
Thank you, Director.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.081
Hosts Next, we have a message
from the student council president.

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:42.876
Please come to the stage,
Student Council President.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.159
Hello, everyone.

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:21.498
I'm the new student council president.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.042
You may recognize me as your school idol.

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:26.002
My name...

00:01:33.385 --> 00:01:35.512
...Is Kosaka Honoka!

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.104
Nanto watashi ga seitokaichou ni
Everyone advised me to do it, so 1 did it -

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:47.607
minna no susume de nacchatta
I became student council president!

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:51.152
Okaasan mo kayotteta
My mom also went to Otonokizaka High,

00:01:51.152 --> 00:01:54.572
otonokizaka ga suki dakedo
and I share her love for it!

00:01:54.572 --> 00:01:58.284
Kore made wa taihen de
Things got serious for a while,

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:03.373
haikou ni narikaketa
and our school was nearly closed down!

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:05.125
Minna to deai
I met everyone here

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.918
L's to deai
I met pg's here

00:02:06.918 --> 00:02:10.255
watashitachi wa koko made yattekita And working
together, we've managed to make it this far.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:13.675
Mirai ni mukai kyou mo utauyo
We sing for today, facing the future,

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:25.353
sukoshizutsu sekai ga mawaridasu and we watch
as the world slowly starts to spin around!

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.525
I'm so tired!

00:02:30.525 --> 00:02:32.318
Good work, Honoka-chan.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:34.362
#1 - Another Love Live! Making
speeches as the student council president

00:02:34.362 --> 00:02:36.614
is totally different than putting on concerts.

00:02:36.614 --> 00:02:38.575
I was so nervous the whole time!

00:02:38.575 --> 00:02:42.245
But it was good. It was typical of you.

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:43.955
What was good about it!?

00:02:43.955 --> 00:02:47.625
We all worked on your speech yesterday!

00:02:48.209 --> 00:02:49.627
Sorry.

00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:51.504
Hello, everyone!

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:53.256
I'm Kosaka Honokal!

00:03:02.599 --> 00:03:05.226
I forgot everything after that.

00:03:06.311 --> 00:03:08.521
I practiced so hard, too!

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:09.689
In any case...

00:03:11.983 --> 00:03:14.944
Take care of all of these
before you go home today.

00:03:14.944 --> 00:03:15.820
All of these!?

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:16.946
Plus this.

00:03:19.324 --> 00:03:21.576
"The cafeteria's curry is bad."

00:03:21.576 --> 00:03:23.703
"The alpacas don't like me."

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:26.206
"I want someone famous to
be at the school festival."

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.332
What are these?

00:03:27.332 --> 00:03:29.751
They're requests from the student body.

00:03:29.751 --> 00:03:32.796
Sheesh! Can't you at least help me a little?

00:03:32.796 --> 00:03:34.923
Umi-chan, you're the vice president!

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:37.550
Naturally, I've already looked through them.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.260
Then do the work!

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.346
This isn't the only job!

00:03:41.679 --> 00:03:44.891
Over there are heaps of umbrellas
that have been left around the school!

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:48.019
You haven't touched the club
activity records, either!

00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:52.899
And we haven't even gotten to the records
from the third years that are in that locker!

00:03:54.192 --> 00:03:55.985
Now that you're the
student council president,

00:03:55.985 --> 00:03:58.988
you have to know more about
this school than anyone else.

00:03:58.988 --> 00:04:01.533
But there are three of us here.

00:04:01.533 --> 00:04:04.369
- If we split the work—
- Kotori, you baby Honoka too much!

00:04:06.704 --> 00:04:09.582
Being the student council
president is hard work!

00:04:09.582 --> 00:04:10.959
Do you understand now?

00:04:11.709 --> 00:04:12.710
Eli-chan!

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:16.214
Working hard, girls?

00:04:16.214 --> 00:04:17.632
Nozomi-chan, too!

00:04:17.632 --> 00:04:18.842
Are you okay?

00:04:18.842 --> 00:04:21.719
Your speech wasn't very good.

00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:24.013
Sorry.

00:04:24.013 --> 00:04:25.348
Anyway, what do you need today?

00:04:25.348 --> 00:04:27.392
Nothing in particular.

00:04:27.392 --> 00:04:29.185
I was just wondering how you were doing.

00:04:29.185 --> 00:04:32.772
I was the one who recommended
you, so I was concerned.

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:35.942
And our dance lessons
start up again tomorrow.

00:04:37.068 --> 00:04:42.615
According to the cards, you may have a lot
of trouble as the student council president.

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:44.075
What?

00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:46.828
That's why you two need to help her out.

00:04:46.828 --> 00:04:48.913
Thank you for your concern.

00:04:48.913 --> 00:04:50.290
Not at all.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.417
If you need any help, let us know.

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:53.877
We'll help with anything.

00:04:54.544 --> 00:04:55.503
Thanks!

00:05:04.178 --> 00:05:05.138
Are you ready?

00:05:05.555 --> 00:05:07.682
I'll show you the results of my training.

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:13.813
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:16.482
I'll make your heartbeat throb "Nico-Nico-Ni"!

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:18.985
I'm Yazawa Nico-Nico. I'm here
to make your heart smile!

00:05:19.402 --> 00:05:21.112
No, no, no!

00:05:21.112 --> 00:05:24.407
Nico-Ni is for! Every! One!

00:05:24.407 --> 00:05:25.366
Gross.

00:05:25.366 --> 00:05:26.284
Hey!

00:05:26.284 --> 00:05:28.912
How dare you!? I worked
really hard yesterday

00:05:28.912 --> 00:05:30.622
- to come up with that!
- I don't care.

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:34.834
Is there any point to the four of us doing this?

00:05:34.834 --> 00:05:37.503
You girls don't understand at all.

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:40.673
From now on, you first years
have to work harder.

00:05:42.926 --> 00:05:48.514
I knew you wouldn't know what to do
on your own, so I came to help you.

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:50.099
As your upperclassman!

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:51.935
What's with the video?

00:05:51.935 --> 00:05:53.269
What are you talking about?

00:05:53.269 --> 00:05:55.939
We're gonna upload it to
the Internet, of course.

00:05:55.939 --> 00:05:58.316
School idols are a global phenomenon now!

00:05:58.316 --> 00:06:00.985
Nowadays, we can show
off to the whole world!

00:06:00.985 --> 00:06:02.779
In addition to concerts,

00:06:02.779 --> 00:06:06.324
how you practice during your day-to-day
lessons can increase your popularity.

00:06:08.284 --> 00:06:12.038
Once people see how diligently
I watch over the first years,

00:06:12.038 --> 00:06:17.085
people will start saying
I should be the center!

00:06:17.085 --> 00:06:18.252
Then I can finally...

00:06:18.252 --> 00:06:20.046
We can hear everything...

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:22.507
Nico!

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:25.510
Huh?

00:06:30.014 --> 00:06:30.974
What?

00:06:31.641 --> 00:06:35.144
Wh—!? Wai—! Wh-What!?

00:06:35.979 --> 00:06:38.231
Kayo-chin, is something wrong?

00:06:38.606 --> 00:06:40.900
N-No way...

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:43.987
Hanayo?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:47.865
This can't be happening!

00:06:50.034 --> 00:06:51.077
No running in the hallway!

00:06:52.662 --> 00:06:54.038
What should I do!?

00:06:54.038 --> 00:06:55.415
This is amazing! Too amazing!

00:06:56.833 --> 00:06:58.584
What's gotten into her?

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:01.129
When it comes to idols,
she always acts like this.

00:07:01.504 --> 00:07:03.756
I like this personality of hers, too.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:06.801
A dream? If this is a dream, tell me now!

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:08.302
What's going on?

00:07:08.302 --> 00:07:09.387
Tell us!

00:07:13.266 --> 00:07:14.600
What?

00:07:15.476 --> 00:07:16.602
No running in the hallway!

00:07:17.437 --> 00:07:18.187
Honoka!

00:07:19.022 --> 00:07:20.106
Yazawa-senpai.

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:21.024
Where's Honoka?

00:07:21.649 --> 00:07:25.153
She said she'd get more work
done in a classroom, and left.

00:07:25.945 --> 00:07:26.863
Honoka-chan!

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:28.322
Rin-chan.

00:07:28.322 --> 00:07:29.323
Where's Honoka-chan?

00:07:29.741 --> 00:07:32.618
She insisted on getting some exercise,
so she went to the roof.

00:07:33.036 --> 00:07:33.953
Honoka!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:35.496
Maki-chan.

00:07:35.496 --> 00:07:36.789
Hey, where's Honoka?

00:07:37.123 --> 00:07:40.084
She said she was hungry,
so she went to go eat.

00:07:43.171 --> 00:07:45.381
Why did we come here?

00:07:45.381 --> 00:07:47.800
Do you know where we
can find Honoka-chan?

00:07:51.095 --> 00:07:53.222
The bread tastes delicious again today!

00:07:53.723 --> 00:07:56.642
Don't move around so much.

00:07:56.642 --> 00:07:58.227
We were looking for you!

00:08:02.065 --> 00:08:05.443
Honoka, there's another one!

00:08:06.444 --> 00:08:09.030
- Another one.
- Another one.

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:12.200
Another one?

00:08:13.034 --> 00:08:15.286
- Another one?
- Another one?

00:08:15.286 --> 00:08:16.496
Another one?

00:08:16.496 --> 00:08:17.955
Love Live!?

00:08:17.955 --> 00:08:23.086
Yes! The first Love Live was a success,
and A-RISE was victorious!

00:08:23.086 --> 00:08:29.550
And amazingly enough, the second
Love Live has already been announced!

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:33.888
This time, it'll be an even bigger event.

00:08:33.888 --> 00:08:35.431
The venue will be several times bigger.

00:08:35.431 --> 00:08:38.726
In addition to performances being uploaded,
there are even plans for live streams!

00:08:38.726 --> 00:08:40.103
That's amazing.

00:08:40.103 --> 00:08:41.979
It's more than just amazing!

00:08:41.979 --> 00:08:44.357
This next part is very important!

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:47.318
This massive Love Live
won't feature rankings.

00:08:47.318 --> 00:08:50.655
Preliminaries will be held in each region,

00:08:50.655 --> 00:08:54.909
with regional representatives
advancing to the final event!

00:08:54.909 --> 00:08:59.580
In other words, the rankings achieved in
popularity polls until now are irrelevant?

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.832
That's right!

00:09:00.832 --> 00:09:03.251
This will turn the world of idols upside down!

00:09:03.251 --> 00:09:05.002
Even low-ranking idols can make it,

00:09:05.002 --> 00:09:09.215
based on their performance
in the preliminaries!

00:09:09.632 --> 00:09:13.845
That means even we have
a chance of participating!

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.429
Yes!

00:09:15.429 --> 00:09:17.056
That's amazing!

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:18.850
This is an incredible opportunity!

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:19.642
Yes!

00:09:19.976 --> 00:09:21.477
We have to do it!

00:09:21.769 --> 00:09:23.146
For sure!

00:09:24.272 --> 00:09:27.567
Okay! Let's aim to perform at Love Live!

00:09:27.567 --> 00:09:28.442
But wait!

00:09:30.236 --> 00:09:32.321
If there are regional preliminaries,

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:36.492
won't that mean we'll have to face A-RISE?

00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:50.965
It's over.

00:09:50.965 --> 00:09:52.300
It's hopeless.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.635
I can't believe we have to beat A-RISE!

00:09:54.635 --> 00:09:56.387
That's impossible...

00:09:56.387 --> 00:09:57.597
It can't be done.

00:10:00.558 --> 00:10:03.102
We should all transfer!

00:10:03.102 --> 00:10:04.770
We can't do that.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:10.610
Facing A-RISE will be difficult,
but we shouldn't give up yet.

00:10:11.903 --> 00:10:13.362
Umi's right.

00:10:13.988 --> 00:10:17.116
If we give up before we start,
we'll never get anywhere.

00:10:17.533 --> 00:10:18.868
You're right.

00:10:19.869 --> 00:10:21.746
We're free to enter if we want.

00:10:22.205 --> 00:10:24.332
Why don't we give it a try?

00:10:24.665 --> 00:10:25.416
Yes.

00:10:30.004 --> 00:10:31.797
Y-You're right!

00:10:31.797 --> 00:10:33.633
It'll be hard, but let's do it!

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:35.051
It's decided, then.

00:10:43.059 --> 00:10:44.143
Honoka?

00:10:46.896 --> 00:10:48.648
Maybe we shouldn't enter.

00:10:52.193 --> 00:10:53.903
What!?

00:10:54.195 --> 00:10:56.322
H-Honoka-chan?

00:10:56.864 --> 00:10:58.282
What did you just...?

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:01.744
I don't think we need to perform at Love Live.

00:11:05.248 --> 00:11:06.624
Love Live!

00:11:07.541 --> 00:11:10.461
Honoka!

00:11:11.796 --> 00:11:14.715
Honoka, do you see your face?

00:11:14.715 --> 00:11:16.592
I do...

00:11:16.592 --> 00:11:19.720
What is your reflection telling you?

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:20.930
What?

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.640
But Honoka...

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.183
Not performing at Love Live?

00:11:24.183 --> 00:11:25.685
That's unbelievable!

00:11:25.685 --> 00:11:27.561
It's Love Live!

00:11:27.561 --> 00:11:29.397
Where every school idol wants to be!

00:11:29.397 --> 00:11:32.566
You seem like you'd be the
first to say we should go!

00:11:33.109 --> 00:11:34.610
R-Really?

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:35.903
Did something happen?

00:11:35.903 --> 00:11:37.488
No, not really.

00:11:37.488 --> 00:11:38.614
Then why?

00:11:38.614 --> 00:11:40.908
Why do you think we don't
need to participate?

00:11:41.409 --> 00:11:45.705
If everyone's happy singing
and dancing, that's all I need.

00:11:45.705 --> 00:11:48.332
We've been practicing with
Love Live as our goal!

00:11:48.332 --> 00:11:49.500
Isn't that right?

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.793
Well...

00:11:50.793 --> 00:11:52.878
This isn't like you.

00:11:52.878 --> 00:11:55.214
Couldn't we at least try?

00:12:01.137 --> 00:12:02.096
I know!

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:05.474
Starting tomorrow, we'll be
busy with our lessons.

00:12:05.891 --> 00:12:07.435
Why don't we go out today?

00:12:07.435 --> 00:12:08.394
What?

00:12:08.769 --> 00:12:09.645
But...

00:12:10.021 --> 00:12:11.147
What?

00:12:11.147 --> 00:12:12.189
Honoka-chan?

00:12:12.189 --> 00:12:15.860
Come on. You need to take
breaks every once in a while.

00:12:21.365 --> 00:12:23.034
Is your crepe good?

00:12:28.122 --> 00:12:29.123
What is this?

00:12:29.665 --> 00:12:31.167
You don't know what purikura is?

00:12:31.167 --> 00:12:33.669
I don't come to these places often.

00:12:35.796 --> 00:12:37.381
Khorosho!

00:12:37.381 --> 00:12:38.632
I'm not finished!

00:12:38.632 --> 00:12:40.593
There! There! There! There! There! There!

00:12:42.261 --> 00:12:43.429
Smart and Cute
Elichika

00:12:45.806 --> 00:12:47.683
I'm so happy.

00:12:47.683 --> 00:12:50.936
Hey, should we be playing around right now?

00:12:50.936 --> 00:12:55.024
Our dance lessons start tomorrow.
I'm sure this is fine every once in a while.

00:12:55.024 --> 00:12:56.317
Yeah, yeah!

00:12:56.317 --> 00:13:00.363
If this is what our leader wants
to do, we have no choice.

00:13:04.992 --> 00:13:07.495
Nozomi-chan, is something wrong?

00:13:09.413 --> 00:13:10.915
No, it's nothing.

00:13:10.915 --> 00:13:13.125
Here, have some juice.

00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:14.126
Thanks.

00:13:25.429 --> 00:13:27.515
Welcome to UTX High!

00:13:27.932 --> 00:13:33.104
We're UTX High's school idol group, A-RISE.

00:13:33.104 --> 00:13:36.273
Is everyone ready to party?

00:13:39.693 --> 00:13:43.656
Maybe Honoka said that we don't need to
do it because she considered everything.

00:13:44.323 --> 00:13:45.366
Everything?

00:13:45.825 --> 00:13:47.118
What's gotten into her?

00:13:47.618 --> 00:13:49.036
I wonder about that, too.

00:13:49.036 --> 00:13:50.621
It's not like her.

00:13:50.621 --> 00:13:51.956
It's not like you, either.

00:13:51.956 --> 00:13:54.583
Hey! I'm being serious here!

00:13:55.167 --> 00:13:59.004
But at this rate, we really
might not go to Love Live.

00:13:59.004 --> 00:14:00.881
That'd be sad.

00:14:01.632 --> 00:14:03.551
What do you want to do, Nico-cchi?

00:14:04.218 --> 00:14:05.344
I...

00:14:06.595 --> 00:14:08.305
Of course I want to go to Love Live!

00:14:09.014 --> 00:14:10.433
Right.

00:14:11.851 --> 00:14:15.688
Maybe it's because she's busy being
the student council president...

00:14:16.063 --> 00:14:20.693
But Honoka-chan would never say she
wouldn't do it just because she's busy.

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:22.069
You're right.

00:14:22.486 --> 00:14:26.949
Right now, p's has a place to
practice and perform together.

00:14:28.492 --> 00:14:32.204
Japanese Sweets Homura
Maybe she feels that's enough.

00:14:35.624 --> 00:14:36.667
Sis.

00:14:36.667 --> 00:14:38.043
Yukiho?

00:14:39.128 --> 00:14:40.254
I saw the news!

00:14:40.254 --> 00:14:42.131
They're holding another Love Live.

00:14:42.131 --> 00:14:43.841
Y-Yeah.

00:14:43.841 --> 00:14:45.593
You'll be entering, won't you?

00:14:48.554 --> 00:14:49.472
You're not!?

00:14:50.723 --> 00:14:52.933
Not you, too!

00:14:52.933 --> 00:14:53.851
You should go.

00:14:54.393 --> 00:14:57.396
Alisa's really looking forward to it, too.

00:14:58.939 --> 00:15:00.024
Besides...

00:15:01.108 --> 00:15:04.445
Do you know when the next
Love Live's finals are?

00:15:04.445 --> 00:15:05.321
No.

00:15:06.822 --> 00:15:08.407
Next March.

00:15:08.991 --> 00:15:14.038
If everything goes well, Alisa and I will
be starting at Otonokizaka in April.

00:15:15.206 --> 00:15:18.918
But if we're entering the school...

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.422
Well, you know, right?

00:15:35.768 --> 00:15:36.727
Eli-chi.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:38.729
What's wrong?

00:15:40.648 --> 00:15:41.607
Nozomi?

00:15:42.525 --> 00:15:44.485
What's with the gloomy expression?

00:15:45.152 --> 00:15:47.238
Come on. Let's go.

00:15:47.238 --> 00:15:49.573
Do you really think we don't need to enter?

00:15:57.248 --> 00:15:59.959
Wow! There's another Love Live!

00:15:59.959 --> 00:16:03.045
Yeah. We'd better support p's again!

00:16:11.929 --> 00:16:12.596
Honoka!

00:16:14.014 --> 00:16:15.057
What's wrong?

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.518
I challenge you!

00:16:21.021 --> 00:16:21.605
Ready?

00:16:22.273 --> 00:16:25.818
We're going to race up these steps!

00:16:25.818 --> 00:16:27.319
Why are we racing?

00:16:27.319 --> 00:16:30.781
It looks like she's trying
to inspire Honoka-chan.

00:16:30.781 --> 00:16:32.241
How pushy of her.

00:16:32.241 --> 00:16:34.159
Maybe another time.

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:36.745
- We've got dance lessons today.
- Love Live!

00:16:36.745 --> 00:16:38.205
I wanna go!

00:16:38.205 --> 00:16:40.124
So let's duke it out here!

00:16:40.124 --> 00:16:42.418
If I win, we'll go to Love Live!

00:16:42.418 --> 00:16:43.794
If you win, we won't!

00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:49.466
Fine.

00:16:53.762 --> 00:16:56.557
Ready? Here we go.

00:16:57.182 --> 00:16:59.018
Ready...

00:16:59.018 --> 00:16:59.643
Go!

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:03.314
No fair, Nico-chan!

00:17:03.939 --> 00:17:06.734
If you're upset about it, come pass me!

00:17:17.578 --> 00:17:20.539
Do you know when the next
Love Live's finals are?

00:17:21.332 --> 00:17:24.043
If we're entering the school...

00:17:25.294 --> 00:17:27.546
Well, you know, right?

00:17:38.098 --> 00:17:39.391
Nico-chan!

00:17:43.187 --> 00:17:45.564
Nico-chan! Are you okay?

00:17:46.523 --> 00:17:47.650
I-I'm fine.

00:17:48.567 --> 00:17:51.236
It's your own fault for cheating.

00:17:52.237 --> 00:17:53.864
Shut up.

00:17:53.864 --> 00:17:57.576
I don't care if I have to
cheat to go to Love Live.

00:17:59.286 --> 00:18:00.245
Nico-chan.

00:18:07.086 --> 00:18:08.087
That's right.

00:18:08.087 --> 00:18:11.924
The three of us will graduate in March.

00:18:11.924 --> 00:18:15.469
We'll only be together until
the end of the school year.

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:22.434
And we can only be school
idols while we're students.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:23.894
But...

00:18:24.228 --> 00:18:26.980
It's not like we're going to
graduate immediately.

00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:31.819
But this is our last chance to go to Love Live.

00:18:32.444 --> 00:18:34.697
If we pass this up...

00:18:35.322 --> 00:18:38.367
I'd like to keep doing this forever.

00:18:38.367 --> 00:18:42.496
Some people attempt to do it
professionally after they graduate.

00:18:43.372 --> 00:18:48.085
But this is the only chance the nine of
us have to go to Love Live together.

00:18:49.253 --> 00:18:51.630
You all...

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.298
We feel the same way.

00:18:53.298 --> 00:18:56.176
Even if we don't make it
through the preliminaries,

00:18:56.176 --> 00:18:58.595
I want there to be some proof
that the nine of us tried.

00:18:59.263 --> 00:19:00.973
Me, too.

00:19:00.973 --> 00:19:03.016
Why don't we give it a try?

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:04.893
Girls...

00:19:05.602 --> 00:19:06.770
What about you, Kotori-chan?

00:19:08.021 --> 00:19:12.151
I'll follow you down
whatever path you choose!

00:19:14.153 --> 00:19:19.658
I bet you're worried you'll cause
trouble for everyone again.

00:19:20.784 --> 00:19:22.953
That you mustn't lose yourself
while preparing for Love Live,

00:19:22.953 --> 00:19:24.663
lose sight of your surroundings,

00:19:25.289 --> 00:19:31.378
and inconvenience the school,
as the student council president.

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:35.424
You got me.

00:19:36.592 --> 00:19:40.763
When we first started, I didn't
have to worry about anything.

00:19:40.763 --> 00:19:44.683
Now, there are times when I
don't know what I should do.

00:19:45.392 --> 00:19:48.270
But, it's the stage we dreamed of being on.

00:19:48.812 --> 00:19:50.731
I want to go, too!

00:19:50.731 --> 00:19:55.319
Since I'm now the student council president,
I might cause more trouble for everyone...

00:19:55.319 --> 00:19:57.279
But I really want to go!

00:20:00.115 --> 00:20:02.201
Girls... What's wrong?

00:20:02.201 --> 00:20:05.162
Honoka, did you forget?

00:20:09.082 --> 00:20:13.921
Datte kanousei kanjitanda
Because I felt the possibility,

00:20:13.921 --> 00:20:18.801
souda susume
I knew to carry on.

00:20:18.801 --> 00:20:24.223
Koukai shitakunai menomae ni
I don't want to have any more regrets.

00:20:24.223 --> 00:20:29.478
Bokura no michi ga aru
Our destined path is before us, so...

00:20:30.604 --> 00:20:31.438
Let's do it!

00:20:31.688 --> 00:20:32.564
Let's do it!

00:20:32.564 --> 00:20:34.566
Okay!

00:20:34.566 --> 00:20:35.526
Let's do it!

00:20:35.526 --> 00:20:36.985
Let's go to Love Live!

00:20:41.406 --> 00:20:42.866
H-Honoka?

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:52.668
Stop, rain!

00:21:09.434 --> 00:21:10.602
You're kidding.

00:21:18.819 --> 00:21:20.487
It really stopped!

00:21:20.487 --> 00:21:23.407
People can do anything if
they put their minds to it!

00:21:23.991 --> 00:21:26.201
Just participating in Love Live isn't enough!

00:21:26.201 --> 00:21:29.496
Let's produce the best
results the nine of us can!

00:21:31.582 --> 00:21:33.166
Let's aim for victory!

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:34.334
Victory!?

00:21:34.668 --> 00:21:36.378
We're going that far!?

00:21:36.378 --> 00:21:38.547
That's quite a bold statement.

00:21:38.547 --> 00:21:39.840
Sounds fun!

00:21:41.133 --> 00:21:45.012
Let's sing our hearts out on
the huge stage at Love Live,

00:21:45.679 --> 00:21:49.016
and be number one!

00:21:49.016 --> 00:21:50.017
Honoka!

00:21:50.017 --> 00:21:51.435
Honoka-chan!

00:21:51.435 --> 00:21:52.394
Honoka!

00:21:52.394 --> 00:21:54.354
All right!

00:22:00.152 --> 00:22:02.613
Here we go!

00:22:04.072 --> 00:22:10.287
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:22:10.287 --> 00:22:17.878
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:22:24.927 --> 00:22:30.265
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:22:30.265 --> 00:22:35.812
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:22:35.812 --> 00:22:40.901
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:22:40.901 --> 00:22:46.031
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:22:46.031 --> 00:22:51.536
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:22:51.536 --> 00:22:57.376
<i>seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can</i>

00:22:57.376 --> 00:23:00.253
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:23:00.253 --> 00:23:05.842
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:23:05.842 --> 00:23:10.639
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:23:10.639 --> 00:23:16.770
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:21.817
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:23:21.817 --> 00:23:27.155
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:23:27.155 --> 00:23:33.870
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:23:35.747 --> 00:23:39.126
Next time on Love Live!
"Aiming for Victory"
